@startuml
!include style.iuml
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowFontSize 14
' Practice exam (Module 2). Client: ViewModels/DashboardViewModel.RefreshPracticeExamsAsync (ApiClient.GetPracticeExamsAsync),
' Views/ExamDashboard.PracticeButton_OnClick (ApiClient.StartSessionAsync; refusal -> MessageBox; ExamWindow in "Report"
' mode, no allowed-apps list, no webcam; afterwards DashboardViewModel.InitializeAsync refreshes the list).
' Server: ExamsController.GetPracticeExams (GET /api/exams/student/practice: IsMock, assigned and eligible, open now) and
' StartSession (POST /api/exams/{id}/start-session), whose gates run in this order: assignment (403), IsEligible (400),
' exam closed and no open session (400), not open yet (400 EXAM_NOT_STARTED), seat (403 SEAT_MISMATCH), then an
' InProgress practice attempt is returned as it is, and only a NEW attempt checks RequireReadiness (400 READINESS_REQUIRED).
' Saving and submitting use the same calls as a real exam; SubmissionService.FinalizeAsync skips the plagiarism check
' when Exam.IsMock and grades when AiEvaluationEnabled.
hide footbox
hide unlinked
skinparam ParticipantPadding 2
skinparam BoxPadding 0
skinparam sequence {
  MessageAlign left
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #E6E6E6
}

participant "Exam\nDashboard" as UI
participant "Dashboard\nViewModel" as VM
participant "ApiClient" as API
participant "Exams\nController" as EC
database "AppDbContext" as DB

[-> VM : dashboard loads
activate VM
VM -> API : get practice exams
activate API
API -> EC : GET practice list
activate EC
EC -> DB : open practice exams\nfor this student
activate DB
DB --> EC : exams, attempts
deactivate DB
EC --> API : practice list
deactivate EC
API --> VM : list
deactivate API
VM -> UI : fill practice picker
deactivate VM
@enduml
